<title>UK: BTP plc says buys Harris Specialty unit.</title>
<headline>BTP plc says buys Harris Specialty unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemicals group BTP Plc said on Thursday that it had agreed to buy PCR Inc, a fine chemicals maker, from Harris Specialty Chemicals Inc for $72.3 million (44.4 million stg).</p>
</text>
